{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-12-07 09:00:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS' INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY VP TO SPEAK AT BANK OF AMERICA 2022 HYDROGEN CONFERENCE ON DECEMBER 14", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SIMON MOORE , VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY, WILL SPEAK\xa0AT THE BANK OF AMERICA 2022 HYDROGEN CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 14, 2022 AT 8:15 A.M.'}